"segments": [
{
"start": 0.11,
"end": 14.48,
"text": " Over the weekend Prince Jackson and his siblings got into the spirit of Halloween for their charity event costume for a cause he sat down with Natalie at the Jackson family home in Encino California to talk about that and in so many ways how he is following his famous father's footsteps."
},
{
"start": 15.73,
"end": 18.43,
"text": " He's the oldest of Michael Jackson's three children."
},
{
"start": 18.73,
"end": 31.43,
"text": "In 1997, Michael Joseph Prince Jackson Jr. was born into pop music's royal family, starting what would become an insatiable fascination with the children of the most famous entertainer in the world."
},
{
"start": 31.55,
"end": 32.53,
"text": "Are you musical at all?"
},
{
"start": 32.71,
"end": 33.35,
"text": "No, not at all."
},
{
"start": 34.07,
"end": 34.79,
"text": " Not at all."
},
{
"start": 34.97,
"end": 35.35,
"text": "I read you."
},
{
"start": 35.45,
"end": 36.43,
"text": "You don't even moonwalk."
},
{
"start": 36.51,
"end": 37.65,
"text": "No, I can't dance."
},
{
"start": 37.69,
"end": 38.23,
"text": "It's very sad."
},
{
"start": 38.27,
"end": 38.85,
"text": "It's very sad."
},
{
"start": 39.01,
"end": 39.73,
"text": "I didn't get that gene."
},
{
"start": 39.83,
"end": 41.99,
"text": "Who's got the gene then in the family?"
},
{
"start": 42.29,
"end": 45.27,
"text": "My sister can sing very well and my brother."
},
{
"start": 46.12,
"end": 47.08,
"text": " He doesn't like to dance either."
},
{
"start": 47.1,
"end": 48.6,
"text": "I think just my sister got it, actually."
},
{
"start": 48.78,
"end": 58.27,
"text": "Prince, his 19-year-old sister, Paris, and 15-year-old brother, Blanket, who changed his name to BG, grew up together under the protective eye of Michael Jackson."
},
{
"start": 58.81,
"end": 63.74,
"text": "In the early years, their superstar father going to great lengths to shield them from the public."
},
{
"start": 64.12,
"end": 65.1,
"text": "That was then."
},
{
"start": 65.16,
"end": 71.03,
"text": "This past weekend, the siblings were in the spotlight for the second annual Costume for a Cause event,"
},
{
"start": 71.41,
"end": 77.97,
"text": " to benefit Heal LA, a charity founded by Prince to help foster kids who have aged out of the system."
},
{
"start": 78.41,
"end": 86.05,
"text": "You're about to be 21, but you're already kind of setting on your own path to making sure that you're helping heal the world."
},
{
"start": 86.43,
"end": 86.75,
"text": "Yes."
},
{
"start": 86.79,
"end": 87.61,
"text": "Where does that come from?"
},
{
"start": 88.43,
"end": 91.38,
"text": "I think it's just the way my dad raised me and my siblings."
},
{
"start": 92.42,
"end": 97.16,
"text": "It's just like an inborn, I guess, something that's bred into us to really give back to the community."
},
{
"start": 97.42,
"end": 99.44,
"text": "What do you get out of the work that you're doing?"
},
{
"start": 100.7,
"end": 113.23,
"text": " Well, my dad always taught me to lead by example, so I hope that I can set a good example that you can have fun by helping other people and you can make a change just by doing that, so encouraging other people to do the same."
},
{
"start": 113.67,
"end": 116.49,
"text": "You said this was all blanket, but he now goes by BG."
},
{
"start": 116.59,
"end": 116.83,
"text": "Yes."
},
{
"start": 116.87,
"end": 117.75,
"text": "BG's idea."
},
{
"start": 118.45,
"end": 119.87,
"text": "Yeah, so he really goes all out."
},
{
"start": 119.89,
"end": 121.64,
"text": "He's got some mazes built all around the house."
},
{
"start": 124.0,
"end": 126.14,
"text": " He goes through everything to make sure everything is in its place."
},
{
"start": 126.16,
"end": 129.81,
"text": "Like if there's a little piece of blood somewhere and he doesn't want it there, he gets moved."
},
{
"start": 130.27,
"end": 131.49,
"text": "There are clowns everywhere."
},
{
"start": 131.51,
"end": 132.35,
"text": "That's my phobia."
},
{
"start": 132.61,
"end": 136.77,
"text": "Being the oldest, I think you have a lot of responsibility on your shoulders, right?"
},
{
"start": 136.85,
"end": 137.65,
"text": "Have you felt that?"
},
{
"start": 138.53,
"end": 141.74,
"text": "Sometimes I do, but I mean, me and my siblings, we get along really well."
},
{
"start": 142.41,
"end": 144.5,
"text": "And especially my sister, she's grown so much."
},
{
"start": 145.08,
"end": 149.92,
"text": " and I think she's been able to really step up and I don't really see myself as like her older brother."
},
{
"start": 149.94,
"end": 155.43,
"text": "It's kind of we're equal partners when it comes down to it and BG is just so mature for his age."
},
{
"start": 155.45,
"end": 156.51,
"text": "It's a pretty strong bond."
},
{
"start": 156.99,
"end": 162.3,
"text": "What are your memories of you know even just sitting and watching music videos with your dad and watching his work?"
},
{
"start": 162.77,
"end": 164.61,
"text": " Well, he didn't really like us watching his work."
},
{
"start": 164.63,
"end": 170.33,
"text": "You know, we didn't really know who he was as the King of Pop until we were significantly older."
},
{
"start": 170.53,
"end": 171.37,
"text": "How did you find out?"
},
{
"start": 171.79,
"end": 179.58,
"text": "When we saw a video of his concert and him performing, and then girls were passing out, and dudes were passing out, and it was just, it was crazy."
},
{
"start": 180.8,
"end": 181.7,
"text": "Why are they doing this?"
},
{
"start": 181.74,
"end": 184.06,
"text": "I see him every day, you know?"
},
{
"start": 184.1,
"end": 188.2,
"text": "What do you think your dad would say looking down on you all now doing this together as a family?"
},
{
"start": 188.34,
"end": 191.81,
"text": "I think he would definitely be proud of the type of work that we're doing and giving back to the community."
},
{
"start": 192.44,
"end": 194.4,
"text": " something that he would have wanted you to do yeah."
}
]
}